## 1) System-level scripts (one set total)

### A) `LEAD LAG`

**Inputs**

* `Sys_Enable` (system enable)
* `AHU1_Failure`  ← from `AHU1_MASTER CONTROL.UNIT_Failure`
* `AHU2_Failure`  ← from `AHU2_MASTER CONTROL.UNIT_Failure`
