* `AHU1_PrimeCmd`  → `AHU1_MASTER CONTROL.UNIT_PrimeCmd`
* `AHU2_PrimeCmd`  → `AHU2_MASTER CONTROL.UNIT_PrimeCmd`
* `LeadUnitNumber` (to BAS / trend)
* `ActiveUnitNumber` (to BAS / trend)
* `LeadFailAlarm` (to BAS)

